  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "41A183A20EE70831",
      "text": "♪Rotom, tom...\\nRotom, tom...♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "32422C00E4F946BF",
      "text": "Veo que la guardia no te ha dado problemas.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "32422D00E4F94872",
      "text": "Estás ante la base del grupo Hada del Team Star:\\nel Escuadrón Ruchbah.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "32422E00E4F94A25",
      "text": "Su cabecilla, Gus, es el mecánico del Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "32422700E4F93E40",
      "text": "Es el más joven de los jefes y tiene mucho\\ntalento como Entrenador. Ándate con ojo.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "32422800E4F93FF3",
      "text": "Su estilo de mando es más bien distante.\\nSuele delegar en sus Reclutas y no involucrarse\\r\\ndirectamente cuando hay jaleo.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_06",
      "hash64": "32422900E4F941A6",
      "text": "Eso sí: tiene muy mal genio. Cuando se enfada,\\nes el primero en lanzarse al campo de batalla.\\c\\nAsí que deberás provocarlo para que dé la cara.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_07",
      "hash64": "32422A00E4F94359",
      "text": "Lo mejor será que derrotes a sus Reclutas uno\\ntras otro; eso seguro que lo hace rabiar.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_08",
      "hash64": "32423300E4F952A4",
      "text": "Aguanta sus acometidas hasta que Gus se digne\\na aparecer.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_fairy_020_cassiopeia_09",
